<%= email_page :violet, icon: 'calendar', label: 'Business matching',
      title: "Let's get you connected",
      tagline: "Business matching at #{@event.title}" %>
<p>Dear <%= @ticket.attendee_name %>,</p>
<p>Thank you for joining us at <strong><%= @event.title %></strong>. We are delighted to have you with us.</p>
<p>As part of your registration, you can book one-on-one meetings with exhibitors and hosts through our business matching programme. Pick a time that works for you and we will take care of the rest.</p>
<%= render 'emails/buttons', primary: ['Book a meeting', @booking_url] %>
<p style="margin-top:28px">We hope this helps you make valuable connections at the event.</p>
<%= render 'emails/signoff', name: @sender_name %>
